---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout
  title="Join the Group"
  description="Join the Group."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <!--<span class="eyebrow"></span>-->
      <h1>Join the Group</h1>
      <p class="desc">
        We are always looking for motivated researchers at all levels! See below for information on how to join.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>



  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Open roles -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label"></span>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">

         <!-- Postdoc -->
        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue);">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Postdoctoral Researcher</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
            We currently do not have any postdoc openings. For the most up to date information, please check 
            <a href="https://academicjobsonline.org" style="color: #FDB515"> AJO</a> and
            <a href="https://inspirehep.net/jobs" style="color: #FDB515"> Inspire HEP</a>.
          </p>
          
          </p>
        </div>
      

        <!-- Graduate students -->
        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue);">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Graduate Students</h3>
              <!-- <span class="tag tag-blue">Open</span>
              <span class="tag" style="margin-left:0.25rem;">PhD Program</span> -->
            </div>
            <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/academic/graduate-degree/graduate-admissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.875rem;">Apply to Berkeley Physics</a>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
            Information on the Berkeley Physics PhD program may be found <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/academic/graduate-degree/graduate-admissions" style="color: #FDB515 ">here</a>. Prospective and admitted PhD students are encourged to contact Professor Salemi on group openings.
          </p>
          <p>
            Current Berkeley PhD students may contact Professor Salemi for information on research rotations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Undergrad -->
        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue);">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Undergraduate Students</h3>
              <!--<span class="tag tag-gold">Open (semester basis)</span>
            </div>
             <a href="mailto:pi@berkeley.edu" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:0.875rem;">Send an email</a> -->
          </div>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
            Undergrads can work in the group for credit or pay.
            There are multiple paid research oppurtunities that are listed below. 
            Contact Professor Salemi to coordinate submitting a proposal. 
            Berkeley physics has a nice list of opportunities locally and at other institutions, found  
            <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/academics/undergraduate-research/research-opportunities-board" style="color: #FDB515 ">here</a>.

          </p>
          <p>  
          Opportunities for Berkeley Students:<br>
          • <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/academics/research-opportunities-board/physics-innovators-initiative-pi2-scholars-program" style="color: #FDB515 ">Pi2</a>: Physics Innovators Initiative Summer Scholars Program.<br>
          • <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/academics/research-opportunities-board/bpurs" style="color: #FDB515 ">BPURS</a>: Berkeley Physics Undergraduate Research Scholars Program.<br>
          • <a href="https://research.berkeley.edu/surf/" style="color: #FDB515">SURF</a>: Summer Undergraduate Research Fellowships.<br>
          • URAP: Undergraduate Research Apprentice Program.<br>
          </p>
          <p>  
          Opportunities for Non-Berkeley Students:<br>
          • <a href="https://science.osti.gov/wdts/suli"style="color: #FDB515 ">SULI</a>: Science Undergraduate Laboratory Internships at LBL.<br>
          • <a href="https://education.lbl.gov/internships/blur-2/" style="color: #FDB515 ">BLUR</a>: Berkeley Lab Undergraduate Research Program at LBL.<br>
          • <a href="https://education.lbl.gov/internships/cci/" style="color: #FDB515 ">CCI</a>: Community College Initiative at LBL.<br>
          </p>
          
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
